{"id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-core-model.md","title":"Core Model Theorem","display":"thm-core-model — Core Model Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-core-model","aliases":["58-thm-core-model"],"display":"thm-core-model — Core Model Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-woodin]]","[[58-df-core-model]]","[[58-df-inner-model]]","[[58-df-zfc]]","[[58-df-gch]]","[[../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-core-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-core-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-core-model — Core Model Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"011f2e5e7950e938\" href=\"?note=011f2e5e7950e938\" title=\"58-df-core-model\">58-df-core-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" href=\"?note=5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" title=\"58-df-inner-model\">58-df-inner-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"58-df-zfc\">58-df-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" href=\"?note=f13d4bbe06c4eb5a\" title=\"58-df-gch\">58-df-gch</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f8f3c414525dd904\" href=\"?note=f8f3c414525dd904\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md\">../batch11/58-df-core-model-k.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,N\\in\\mathsf{Cls},\\quad\\delta\\in V\">\\(K,N\\in\\mathsf{Cls},\\quad\\delta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{GCH}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls},\\quad\\mathrm{Woodin}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S,\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S\\subseteq\\mathsf{Cls},\\quad\\mathrm{Woodin}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}core\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\neg\\exists N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(N)\\land N\\models\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\right)\\to\\exists K\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(K)\\land K\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}core\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\neg\\exists N\\;\\exists\\delta\\;\\left(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(N)\\land N\\models\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\right)\\to\\exists K\\;\\left(\\mathrm{CoreModel}_S(K)\\land\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(K)\\land K\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathrm{GCH}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relevant hypothesis excludes an inner model with a Woodin cardinal, not merely a Woodin cardinal visible in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> denotes the canonical fine-structural core model below a Woodin cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da31